{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TIME TO PICK UP YOUR BOWS AND 1 ARROW!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well, maybe if it weren't for the circumstances in which you find yourselves, these challenges are easy to solve, but now you have to rely on each other because of the curse of the Sorcerer who took away your most valuable possessions! Your arrows! Now you have to share 1 cursed arrow for you 2...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825740/extras/e2c6d6a616e015a57d0a4bf6112ef756.poster.webp?t=1756826345\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825740/extras/e2c6d6a616e015a57d0a4bf6112ef756.webp?t=1756826345\" class=\"bb_img\" width=2048 height=566 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>THE GAME IS FOR 2 PLAYERS ONLY!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't play 1 or if there are 3 or more of you, you can play 4, but if you split into 2 pairs, you get the idea.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825740/extras/5baf1ebe08c11d3e7c34b244ae43d08d.avif?t=1756826345\" width=591 height=76 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Bows 1 Arrow is a \u0441oop action puzzle platforming about your adventure with unique shooting mechanic that allows each player to shoot in queue ONLY after each other. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To make things worse the Sorcerer build castel as a maze of archery challenges, platforms and deadly minions, all that would be much more simplier if you only had more than 1 arrow...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825740/extras/2d632f6503501bb7127d426ebce0ceb8.avif?t=1756826345\" width=591 height=76 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We offer you (for now):</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Boss battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 diffrent locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 secret levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D platform jumping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Logic puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighting the Sorcerer's minions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-operative 3D platform jumping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 bows</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 arrow</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TO BE ADDED</strong></h2></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More information can be found in Roadmap section. In two words, more levels.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Is started\u2026","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3825740/613c0eec43fde90e981350250c7eca180413ffa4.jpg"},{"name":"Hit and RUN","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3825740/3c196305e7615451fde08b84706286bfeb7823b5.jpg"},{"name":"Parkour","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3825740/7ded49a9b2c04e2325644da8475c413505174d70.jpg"},{"name":"Familiar rat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3825740/9cbb29f8c74ac7135a6d8ba6a1a35ef3e3613d15.jpg"},{"name":"Lucid dream","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3825740/fb3c02f329a5af46901a4004d2abe6facc410b18.jpg"},{"name":"If i head a weapon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3825740/58226e7600b6e13411311e4ea9554152d5f1bd95.jpg"},{"name":"I hate labyrinths","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3825740/041354a2ba3c58b3fa5454e6e960faa85